				<description>


&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4070&quot;&gt;SCP-4070&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-4071 | &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4072&quot;&gt;SCP-4072&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
