://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3681">SCP-3681</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4612">SCP-4612</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5074">SCP-5074</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5097">SCP-5097</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Unknown（未知）</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3005">SCP-3005</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Unnecessary（不必要）</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lily-s-proposal">Lily的提案</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4023">SCP-4023</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5143">SCP-5143</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Yesod（基础<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-716308-21" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >21</a></sup>）</td> <td>项目已整合于基金会的指挥机构。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/spikebrennan-s-proposal">spikebrennan的提案</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4436">SCP-4436</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Zeno（芝诺<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-716308-22" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >22</a></sup>）</td> <td>项目具有中等收容难度以及低威胁性。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2005">SCP-2005</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Zurvan</td> <td>项目构成了基准现实的某个方面且不应受到干扰。</td> <td><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5103">SCP-5103</a></td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h2><span>子类分级</span></h2> <p>由于某些异常并不完全符合标准收容分级——同时保证不自己创建一个新的分级——一些子类分级已被创建以用于进一步描述它们的属性和/或它们的收容。</p> <div class="list"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;子类分级&nbsp;◄</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;子类分级&nbsp;▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <h3><span>后缀系统</span></h3> <p>以下的子类分级被附加到标准分级中（<em>举例：</em>Safe-alterius）以表示异常的属性。这些类中有几个缺乏既定的定义；在这种情况下，定义已被我们推断出来。</p> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>分级名称</th> <th>分级定义</th> <th>典例</th> </tr> <tr> <td>alterius</td> <td>项目为地外实体。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-824">SCP-824</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1041">SCP-1041</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1141">SCP-1141</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>doctrina</td> <td>项目正在进行调查或测试。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1306">SCP-1306</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5080">SCP-5080</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5211">SCP-5211</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5235">SCP-5235</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>exsequi</td> <td>项目可独立行动。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-928">SCP-928</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1268">SCP-1268</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1606">SCP-1606</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1646">SCP-1646</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1846">SCP-1846</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1868">SCP-1868</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2020">SCP-2020</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4766">SCP-4766</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>flecto</td> <td>项目表现出一种或多种生物异变性状。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-625">SCP-625</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>impetus</td> <td>项目是敌对的。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-066">SCP-066</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-619">SCP-619</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-984">SCP-984</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1626">SCP-1626</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>nuntii</td> <td>项目具有模因性质。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-868">SCP-868</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1246">SCP-1246</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1248">SCP-1248</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1448">SCP-1448</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4766">SCP-4766</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>numen</td> <td>项目与神明相关。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1564">SCP-1564</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1704">SCP-1704</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1902">SCP-1902</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3906">SCP-3906</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4736">重担 ≡ 勿煞风景</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>potissimi</td> <td>项目的收容措施高度重要。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2959">SCP-2959</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>praedico</td> <td>项目具有预言能力。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1668">SCP-1668</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>prodest</td> <td>项目具有实用性。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-066">SCP-066</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5708">SCP-5708</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5211">SCP-5211</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>provisi</td> <td>除非另有规定，否则项目将被临时指定为某分级。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2721">SCP-2721</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5041">SCP-5041</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5331">SCP-5331</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5411">SCP-5411</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>reliquia</td> <td>项目是一件手工艺品或者遗物。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1962">SCP-1962</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>supernus</td> <td>项目与地球或太阳系的距离太远和/或不明显，因此无法优先处理。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5331">SCP-5331</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5471">SCP-5471</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>ubique</td> <td>项目有广域性、地域性或其它</td> <td>待分配；可参考<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1422">SCP-1422</a></td> </tr> </table> <h3><span>种类系统</span></h3> <p>以下子类分级与标准分级一同使用（<em>举例：</em>Safe // Location）来表示适用的收容方法。</p> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>分级名称</th> <th>分级定义</th> <th>典例</th> </tr> <tr> <td>Location</td> <td>项目需要围绕其建立收容措施。</td> <td>待分配</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Object</td> <td>项目不需要围绕其位置建立收容措施，也不需要反制性收容程序。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2156">SCP-2156</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Phenomenon</td> <td>项目本身包含收容措施，该措施具有异常性质。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1422">SCP-1422</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5107">SCP-5107</a></td> </tr> </table> <h3><span>项目/收容系统</span></h3> <p>以下子类分级为项目等级以及被指定为收容等级的传统分级。（<em>举例：</em><strong>项目等级：</strong>Artifact；<strong>收容等级：</strong>Safe）它们表示被收容的项目的特征并可相互结合使用。（<em>举例：</em>Artifact/Audiovisual）</p> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>分级名称</th> <th>分级定义</th> <th>典例</th> </tr> <tr> <td>Artifact</td> <td></td> <td><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4397">SCP-4397</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4688">SCP-4688</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Audiovisual</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3362">SCP-3362</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Avian</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3095">SCP-3095</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Canine</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4808">SCP-4808</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Crustacean</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3485">SCP-3485</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Divine</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4804">SCP-4804</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Ectoentropic</td> <td></td> <td><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3339">SCP-3339</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Edifice</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3248">SCP-3248</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4348">SCP-4348</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5680">SCP-5680</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5981">SCP-5981</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Event</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4804">SCP-4804</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Extraterrestrial</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3296">SCP-3296</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.