a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/classification-committee-memo">备忘录链接</a><br /> <div class="arrows"></div> <div class="octagon"></div> <div class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="anom-bar-container item-YYYY clear-3 机密 maksur dark 警告 {$american} lang-cn"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item"><span class="lang-cn">项目编号：</span><span class="lang-tr">項目編號：</span></span><span class="number">YYYY</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level"><span class="lang-cn">等级</span><span class="lang-tr">等級</span>3</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">收容等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">收容等級：</span></div> <div class="class-text">机密</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">次要等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">次要等級：</span></div> <div class="class-text">maksur</div> </div> </div> <div class="disrupt-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">扰动等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">擾動等級：</span></div> <div class="class-text">dark</div> </div> <div class="risk-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">风险等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">風險等級：</span></div> <div class="class-text">警告</div> </div> </div> <div class="diamond-part"> <div class="danger-diamond"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/classification-committee-memo">备忘录链接</a><br /> <div class="arrows"></div> <div class="octagon"></div> <div class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="anom-bar-container item-ZZZZ clear-6 机密 chhokmah amida 需谨慎 {$american} lang-cn"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item"><span class="lang-cn">项目编号：</span><span class="lang-tr">項目編號：</span></span><span class="number">ZZZZ</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level"><span class="lang-cn">等级</span><span class="lang-tr">等級</span>6</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">收容等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">收容等級：</span></div> <div class="class-text">机密</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">次要等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">次要等級：</span></div> <div class="class-text">chhokmah</div> </div> </div> <div class="disrupt-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">扰动等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">擾動等級：</span></div> <div class="class-text">amida</div> </div> <div class="risk-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">风险等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">風險等級：</span></div> <div class="class-text">需谨慎</div> </div> </div> <div class="diamond-part"> <div class="danger-diamond"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/classification-committee-memo">备忘录链接</a><br /> <div class="arrows"></div> <div class="octagon"></div> <div class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <h2><span>所以这就是泥萌要的LOGO哒！</span></h2> <h3><span>额外图标为全部自绘，基础图标为ACS固有。</span></h3> <h3><span>分级与相关注释参考<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/esoteric-classes-complete-list">机密分级完整列表</a></span></h3> <h6><span>不定期更新哒，以“公认机密分级”为主。（小声）</span></h6> <div class="step_container"> <h1><span>ACS额外图标</span></h1> <div class="icons"> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/shineshadowd:gyd4/Cernnunos.svg" alt="Cernnunos.svg" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">Cernnunos（塞努诺斯）<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-994033-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup></div> <div class="icon_link"><a href="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/shineshadowd:gyd4/Cernnunos.svg">链接</a></div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/shineshadowd:gyd4/Chhokmah.svg" alt="Chhokmah.svg" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">Chhokmah（智慧）<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-994033-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup></div> <div class="icon_link"><a href="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/shineshadowd:gyd4/Chhokmah.svg">链接</a></div> </div> <div class="icon_container"> <div class="icon_image color-white"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/shineshadowd:gyd4/Continua.svg" alt="Continua.svg" class="image" /></div> <div class="icon_name">Continua（连续体）<sup class="foot